---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Timings in nanoseconds (ns) per call of function, average across input values.
var = coefficient of variation (stddev / mean) across input values, as percentage.
corr = correlation coefficient versus the bit density of input values.
ops/sec = average number of operations per second = 10^9 / average timing.
ARITHMEAN = arithmetic mean of all average function times, in nanoseconds.
GEOMEAN = geometric mean of all average function times, in nanoseconds.
Default repetitions per function = 5 (outer) * 65 (bit densities) * 1 (inner) = 3250000
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

